/**
 * Defines particle shot references for various weapon types.
 *
 * Includes ion cannon, laser cannon, and turbolaser shots.
 *
 * As well as X-Wing, TIE fighter, Death Star, and mining beam shots.
 *
 * Plus references proton rockets, discord missiles, and siege cannons.
 *
 * Each shot links to a separate rules file defining the shot particles.
 * 
 * Allows loading different visual shot effects into the game.
 * IDEAS: (D.O.T. Effects e.g., "Fire", "Radiation", "Healing")

 */